{"15:1:1":"Alif Lâm Râʼ","15:1:2":"Ceux-là","15:1:3":"(sont les) Versets","15:1:4":"(du) Livre","15:1:5":"et (d’)une récitation","15:1:6":"claire. »","15:2:1":"Peut-être","15:2:2":"souhaiteront","15:2:3":"ceux qui","15:2:4":"ont mécru","15:2:5":"qu’","15:2:6":"ils avaient été","15:2:7":"musulmans.","15:3:1":"Laisse-les","15:3:2":"(dans l’état où) ils mangent","15:3:3":"et se réjouissent","15:3:4":"et les distrait","15:3:5":"l’espoir lointain.","15:3:6":"Et ensuite bientôt","15:3:7":"ils sauront.","15:4:1":"Et ne pas","15:4:2":"Nous avons détruit","15:4:3":"de","15:4:4":"village","15:4:5":"sauf","15:4:6":"alors qu’(il y avait) à lui","15:4:7":"une prescription (de terme)","15:4:8":"connue.","15:5:1":"Ne","15:5:2":"devance (pas)","15:5:3":"de","15:5:4":"communauté","15:5:5":"son terme","15:5:6":"et ne pas","15:5:7":"ils peuvent retarder.","15:6:1":"Et ils ont dit :","15:6:2":"« Ô","15:6:3":"celui qui","15:6:4":"a été descendu en étapes","15:6:5":"à Lui","15:6:6":"Le Rappel,","15:6:7":"Certes, tu (es)","15:6:8":"certainement fou.","15:7:1":"Pourquoi","15:7:2":"ne","15:7:3":"nous amènes-tu (pas)","15:7:4":"[] les anges","15:7:5":"si","15:7:6":"tu es","15:7:7":"parmi","15:7:8":"les véridiques ? »","15:8:1":"Ne pas","15:8:2":"Nous faisons descendre en étapes","15:8:3":"les anges","15:8:4":"sauf","15:8:5":"pour ce qui est dû","15:8:6":"et ne pas","15:8:7":"ils seraient","15:8:8":"alors","15:8:9":"des gens qui reçoivent un délai.","15:9:1":"Certes, nous","15:9:2":"Nous","15:9:3":"Nous avons fait descendre en étapes","15:9:4":"Le Rappel.","15:9:5":"Et certes, Nous (sommes)","15:9:6":"à Lui","15:9:7":"certainement des gardiens. »","15:10:1":"Et très certainement","15:10:2":"Nous avons envoyé (des Messagers)","15:10:3":"[d’]","15:10:4":"avant toi","15:10:5":"dans","15:10:6":"(les) groupes","15:10:7":"(des) anciens.","15:11:1":"Et ne pas","15:11:2":"leur est venu","15:11:3":"de","15:11:4":"Messager","15:11:5":"sans qu’","15:11:6":"ils se moquaient","15:11:7":"de lui","15:11:8":"ils se moquaient.","15:12:1":"Ainsi","15:12:2":"Nous le faisons pénétrer","15:12:3":"dans","15:12:4":"(les) cœurs","15:12:5":"(des) criminels.","15:13:1":"Ne pas","15:13:2":"ils croient","15:13:3":"en lui","15:13:4":"alors que certes","15:13:5":"est passée","15:13:6":"(la) manière de se comporter","15:13:7":"(des) anciens.","15:14:1":"Et si","15:14:2":"Nous ouvrions","15:14:3":"à eux","15:14:4":"une porte","15:14:5":"du","15:14:6":"[le] ciel","15:14:7":"et ils se mettraient ensuite de jour","15:14:8":"en elle","15:14:9":"à monter,","15:15:1":"ils diraient certainement :","15:15:2":"« Seulement","15:15:3":"ont été couverts","15:15:4":"nos yeux.","15:15:5":"Plutôt,","15:15:6":"nous (sommes)","15:15:7":"des gens","15:15:8":"ensorcelés. »","15:16:1":"Et très certainement","15:16:2":"Nous avons placé","15:16:3":"dans","15:16:4":"le ciel","15:16:5":"des constellations","15:16:6":"et les avons enjolivés","15:16:7":"pour les observateurs.","15:17:1":"Et Nous l’avons protégé","15:17:2":"de","15:17:3":"chaque","15:17:4":"diable","15:17:5":"banni","15:18:1":"sauf","15:18:2":"quiconque","15:18:3":"contourne secrètement pour accéder","15:18:4":"(à) l’ouïe,","15:18:5":"alors le suivra","15:18:6":"un feu brillant","15:18:7":"clair.","15:19:1":"Et la terre,","15:19:2":"Nous l’avons étendue","15:19:3":"et avons jeté","15:19:4":"sur elle","15:19:5":"des montagnes encrées fermement","15:19:6":"et avons fait pousser","15:19:7":"sur elle","15:19:8":"de","15:19:9":"chaque","15:19:10":"chose","15:19:11":"équilibrée.","15:20:1":"Et avons fait","15:20:2":"pour vous","15:20:3":"en elle","15:20:4":"des subsistances","15:20:5":"et (pour) celui dont","15:20:6":"vous n’êtes pas","15:20:7":"à lui","15:20:8":"du tout des approvisionneurs.","15:21:1":"Et (il n’y a) pas","15:21:2":"de","15:21:3":"chose","15:21:4":"sans (qu’il y ait)","15:21:5":"auprès (de) Nous","15:21:6":"ses richesses stockées","15:21:7":"et ne pas","15:21:8":"Nous la faisons descendre en étapes","15:21:9":"sauf","15:21:10":"avec une mesure","15:21:11":"connue.","15:22:1":"Et Nous avons envoyé","15:22:2":"les vents","15:22:3":"(alors qu’ils sont) fécondants","15:22:4":"et Nous avons ensuite fait descendre","15:22:5":"du","15:22:6":"[le] ciel","15:22:7":"de l’eau","15:22:8":"et vous donnons à boire (d’)elle","15:22:9":"et ne pas","15:22:10":"vous (êtes)","15:22:11":"à elle","15:22:12":"du tout des conservateurs.","15:23:1":"Et certes, Nous,","15:23:2":"certainement Nous,","15:23:3":"Nous donnons la vie","15:23:4":"et Nous donnons la mort","15:23:5":"et Nous (sommes)","15:23:6":"Les Héritiers.","15:24:1":"Et très certainement","15:24:2":"Nous avons connu","15:24:3":"ceux qui viennent d’abord","15:24:4":"parmi vous","15:24:5":"et très certainement","15:24:6":"Nous avons connu","15:24:7":"ceux qui viennent après.","15:25:1":"Et certes,","15:25:2":"ton Maître","15:25:3":"Lui","15:25:4":"vous assemblera.","15:25:5":"Certes, Il (est)","15:25:6":"parfaitement sage,","15:25:7":"parfaitement savant.","15:26:1":"Et très certainement","15:26:2":"Nous avons créé","15:26:3":"l’humain","15:26:4":"d’","15:26:5":"argile","15:26:6":"de","15:26:7":"boue noire","15:26:8":"puante.","15:27:1":"Et le djinn,","15:27:2":"Nous l’avons créé","15:27:3":"[d’]","15:27:4":"auparavant","15:27:5":"du","15:27:6":"feu","15:27:7":"(du) vent à grande chaleur.","15:28:1":"Et (mentionne) quand","15:28:2":"a dit","15:28:3":"ton Maître","15:28:4":"aux anges :","15:28:5":"« Certes, Je","15:28:6":"(serais Le) Créateur","15:28:7":"(d’)un humain","15:28:8":"(fait) d’","15:28:9":"argile","15:28:10":"de","15:28:11":"boue noire","15:28:12":"puante.","15:29:1":"Donc, quand","15:29:2":"Je l’aurai formé de manière uniforme","15:29:3":"et aurai soufflé","15:29:4":"en lui","15:29:5":"de","15:29:6":"Mon esprit,","15:29:7":"alors tombez","15:29:8":"devant lui","15:29:9":"prosternés. »","15:30:1":"Donc se sont prosternés","15:30:2":"les anges","15:30:3":"chacun (d’)eux","15:30:4":"tous ensembles","15:31:1":"sauf","15:31:2":"Iblîs,","15:31:3":"il a refusé","15:31:4":"d’","15:31:5":"être","15:31:6":"parmi","15:31:7":"ceux qui se prosternent.","15:32:1":"Il a dit :","15:32:2":"« Ô Iblîs !","15:32:3":"Qu’est-ce qu’(il y a)","15:32:4":"à toi","15:32:5":"que ne pas","15:32:6":"tu sois","15:32:7":"parmi","15:32:8":"ceux qui se prosternent ? »","15:33:1":"Il a dit :","15:33:2":"« Ne pas","15:33:3":"j’ai été (tel)","15:33:4":"à me prosterner","15:33:5":"devant un humain","15:33:6":"(qui) Tu l’a créé","15:33:7":"d’","15:33:8":"argile","15:33:9":"de","15:33:10":"boue noire","15:33:11":"puante ! »","15:34:1":"Il a dit :","15:34:2":"« Sors alors","15:34:3":"de lui","15:34:4":"car certes, tu","15:34:5":"(es) banni.","15:35:1":"Et certes,","15:35:2":"(est) sur toi","15:35:3":"la malédiction","15:35:4":"jusqu’au","15:35:5":"Jour","15:35:6":"(du) Jugement avec Rétribution. »","15:36:1":"Il a dit :","15:36:2":"« Mon Maître !","15:36:3":"Accorde-moi alors un délai","15:36:4":"jusqu’au","15:36:5":"Jour (où)","15:36:6":"ils seront ressuscités. »","15:37:1":"Il a dit :","15:37:2":"« Alors certes, tu","15:37:3":"(es) parmi","15:37:4":"ceux qui reçoivent un délai,","15:38:1":"jusqu’au","15:38:2":"Jour","15:38:3":"(du) temps","15:38:4":"connu. »","15:39:1":"Il a dit :","15:39:2":"« Mon Maître !","15:39:3":"Parce que","15:39:4":"Tu m’as égaré du droit chemin,","15:39:5":"j’enjoliverai très certainement","15:39:6":"pour eux","15:39:7":"sur","15:39:8":"la terre","15:39:9":"et les égarerai très certainement du droit chemin","15:39:10":"tous ensembles,","15:40:1":"sauf","15:40:2":"Tes esclaves","15:40:3":"parmi eux","15:40:4":"élus. »","15:41:1":"Il a dit :","15:41:2":"« Ceci (est)","15:41:3":"un chemin","15:41:4":"vers moi","15:41:5":"droit.","15:42:1":"Certes,","15:42:2":"Mes esclaves,","15:42:3":"il n’y a pas","15:42:4":"à toi","15:42:5":"contre eux","15:42:6":"(d’)autorité","15:42:7":"sauf","15:42:8":"quiconque","15:42:9":"te suit","15:42:10":"parmi","15:42:11":"les égarés du droit chemin.","15:43:1":"Et certes,","15:43:2":"(L’)Enfer","15:43:3":"(est) leur endroit promis,","15:43:4":"tous ensembles.","15:44:1":"(Il y a) à lui","15:44:2":"sept","15:44:3":"portes.","15:44:4":"À chaque","15:44:5":"porte","15:44:6":"(il y a) d’eux","15:44:7":"une partie","15:44:8":"assignée. »","15:45:1":"Certes,","15:45:2":"les pieux (seront)","15:45:3":"dans","15:45:4":"des jardins à hautes herbes","15:45:5":"et des sources.","15:46:1":"« Entrez (en) eux","15:46:2":"avec de la paix","15:46:3":"(en étant) des gens en sécurité. »","15:47:1":"Et Nous enlèverons","15:47:2":"ce qui (est)","15:47:3":"dans","15:47:4":"leurs poitrines","15:47:5":"de","15:47:6":"rancune,","15:47:7":"(étant) des frères","15:47:8":"sur","15:47:9":"des lits","15:47:10":"(en étant) des gens qui se font face.","15:48:1":"Ne","15:48:2":"les touchera (pas)","15:48:3":"en eux","15:48:4":"de la fatigue","15:48:5":"et ne pas","15:48:6":"ils (seront)","15:48:7":"d’eux","15:48:8":"du tout sortis.","15:49:1":"Informe","15:49:2":"Mes esclaves","15:49:3":"que Je","15:49:4":"(suis) Moi","15:49:5":"Le Grand Pardonneur,","15:49:6":"Le Très Miséricordieux.","15:50:1":"Et que","15:50:2":"Mon châtiment","15:50:3":"(est) lui","15:50:4":"le châtiment","15:50:5":"douloureux.","15:51:1":"Et informe-les","15:51:2":"des","15:51:3":"invités","15:51:4":"(d’)Abraham,","15:52:1":"quand","15:52:2":"ils sont entrés","15:52:3":"auprès (de) lui","15:52:4":"et ont ensuite dit :","15:52:5":"« (Nous te saluons avec de la) paix ! »","15:52:6":"Il a dit :","15:52:7":"« Certes, nous","15:52:8":"(sommes) de vous","15:52:9":"effrayés. »","15:53:1":"Ils ont dit :","15:53:2":"« Ne","15:53:3":"sois (pas) effrayé.","15:53:4":"Certes, nous","15:53:5":"t’annonçons bonne nouvelle","15:53:6":"d’un garçon","15:53:7":"savant ! »","15:54:1":"Il a dit :","15:54:2":"« Est-ce que vous m’avez annoncé bonne nouvelle","15:54:3":"malgré","15:54:4":"(le fait) que","15:54:5":"m’a touché","15:54:6":"la vieillesse ?","15:54:7":"De quoi donc","15:54:8":"annoncez-vous bonne nouvelle ?","15:55:1":"Ils ont dit :","15:55:2":"« Nous t’avons annonçé bonne nouvelle","15:55:3":"de la vérité,","15:55:4":"donc ne","15:55:5":"sois (pas)","15:55:6":"parmi","15:55:7":"ceux qui désespèrent (de la miséricorde). »","15:56:1":"Il a dit :","15:56:2":"« Et qui","15:56:3":"désespère","15:56:4":"de","15:56:5":"(La) Miséricorde","15:56:6":"(de) son Maître","15:56:7":"sauf","15:56:8":"les égarés ? »","15:57:1":"Il a dit :","15:57:2":"« Donc quelle","15:57:3":"(est) votre affaire,","15:57:4":"ô","15:57:5":"[les] messagers ! »","15:58:1":"Ils ont dit :","15:58:2":"« Certes, nous","15:58:3":"avons été envoyé","15:58:4":"vers","15:58:5":"des gens","15:58:6":"criminels,","15:59:1":"sauf","15:59:2":"(la) famille","15:59:3":"(de) Lot.","15:59:4":"Certes, nous (serons)","15:59:5":"certainement ceux qui les sauverons","15:59:6":"tous ensembles,","15:60:1":"sauf","15:60:2":"sa femme,","15:60:3":"nous avons déterminé","15:60:4":"qu’elle (sera)","15:60:5":"certainement parmi","15:60:6":"ceux qui restent. »","15:61:1":"Et ensuite, quand","15:61:2":"sont arrivés","15:61:3":"(chez les) gens","15:61:4":"(de) Lot","15:61:5":"les messagers,","15:62:1":"il a dit :","15:62:2":"« Certes, vous (êtes)","15:62:3":"des gens","15:62:4":"inconnus. »","15:63:1":"Ils ont dit :","15:63:2":"« Plutôt,","15:63:3":"nous t’avons apporté","15:63:4":"[] ce dont","15:63:5":"ils se mettaient en doute","15:63:6":"au sujet de lui","15:63:7":"ils se mettaient en doute.","15:64:1":"Et nous te sommes venus","15:64:2":"avec la vérité.","15:64:3":"Et certes, nous","15:64:4":"(sommes) certainement véridiques.","15:65:1":"Voyage donc de nuit","15:65:2":"avec ta famille","15:65:3":"pendant une partie","15:65:4":"de","15:65:5":"la nuit","15:65:6":"et suis","15:65:7":"leurs dos","15:65:8":"et que ne","15:65:9":"se tourne (pas)","15:65:10":"parmi vous","15:65:11":"qui que ce soit","15:65:12":"et avancez","15:65:13":"où","15:65:14":"vous êtes ordonnés ! »","15:66:1":"Et Nous avons annoncé la décision","15:66:2":"à lui","15:66:3":"(de) cette","15:66:4":"affaire,","15:66:5":"que","15:66:6":"(ce) qui reste","15:66:7":"(de) ceux-là","15:66:8":"(sera) éliminé (alors qu’ils seront)","15:66:9":"des gens qui atteignent l’aube.","15:67:1":"Et sont arrivés","15:67:2":"(les) gens","15:67:3":"(de) la ville","15:67:4":"(alors qu’)ils recevaient bonnes nouvelles.","15:68:1":"Il a dit :","15:68:2":"« Certes,","15:68:3":"ceux-là (sont)","15:68:4":"mes invités,","15:68:5":"donc ne","15:68:6":"me causez (pas) de honte.","15:69:1":"Et craignez avec piété","15:69:2":"Allâh","15:69:3":"et ne","15:69:4":"me causez (pas) de disgrâce. »","15:70:1":"Ils ont dit :","15:70:2":"« Et est-ce que ne pas","15:70:3":"nous t’avons interdit","15:70:4":"de (protéger qui que ce soit parmi)","15:70:5":"toutes les générations de chaque créature ?","15:71:1":"Il a dit :","15:71:2":"« Celles-là (sont)","15:71:3":"mes filles,","15:71:4":"si","15:71:5":"vous êtes","15:71:6":"des gens qui font. »","15:72:1":"Par ta période de vie !","15:72:2":"Certes, ils (étaient)","15:72:3":"certainement dans","15:72:4":"leur confusion","15:72:5":"(alors qu’)ils vagabondaient.","15:73:1":"Et les a ensuite frappés","15:73:2":"le cri (alors qu’ils étaient)","15:73:3":"des gens qui atteignent le lever du soleil.","15:74:1":"Et Nous avons ensuite fait","15:74:2":"(de) sa plus haute partie","15:74:3":"sa plus basse partie","15:74:4":"et avons fait pleuvoir","15:74:5":"sur eux","15:74:6":"des pierres","15:74:7":"d’","15:74:8":"argile sec et dur.","15:75:1":"Certes,","15:75:2":"(il y a) en","15:75:3":"cela","15:75:4":"certainement des signes","15:75:5":"pour ceux qui aperçoivent.","15:76:1":"Et certes, elle (=la ville de Lot)","15:76:2":"(était) certainement sur une voie","15:76:3":"établie (=connue).","15:77:1":"Certes,","15:77:2":"(il y a) en","15:77:3":"cela","15:77:4":"certainement un signe","15:77:5":"pour les croyants.","15:78:1":"Et certes,","15:78:2":"étaient","15:78:3":"(les) compagnons","15:78:4":"(des) arbres","15:78:5":"certainement des injustes.","1